diff --git a/old-origin/README.md b/old-origin/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..42e5735
--- /dev/null
+++ b/old-origin/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# Old origin deployment (`https://order.thedailygrind.coffee`)
+
+The installed app is moving from `https://order.thedailygrind.coffee` to
+`https://thedailygrind.coffee` (same site: `thedailygrind.coffee`), using Web App
+Origin Migration so OS shortcuts / home-screen icons carry over.
+
+When deploying this repo to the **old** origin, override these files:
+
+| Source                                   | Serve at                                            |
+| ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
+| `old-origin/manifest.webmanifest`        | `/manifest.webmanifest` (adds `migrate_to`)          |
+| `old-origin/web-app-origin-association`  | `/.well-known/web-app-origin-association`            |
+
+(`/.well-known/web-app-origin-association` is also committed at the repo root, so
+serving the repo as-is on the old origin already authorizes the migration.)
+
+Serve the association file with `Content-Type: application/json`.
+
+Notes:
+- Only the *installation* migrates. Cookies, localStorage, IndexedDB and
+  permissions are origin-bound and must be moved separately.
+- Supported in Chrome/Edge 149+. Other browsers see the "We've moved" banner
+  rendered by `index.html` on the old origin.
+- To make migration mandatory, add `"behavior": "force"` to the `migrate_from`
+  entry in the new origin's `manifest.webmanifest`.
